er":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master`), it mostly works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_particles2d_gizmos.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18711311/test_particles2d_gizmos.zip)\r\n\r\nI noticed an issue with GPUParticles2D that has a box emitter. Its gizmo isn't at the correct position:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a945e753-f289-4a52-ad25-5523417e7031)\r\n\r\nThis doesn't occur with other emission shape types and occurs regardless of whether the scene root is transformed. \r\n\r\nHowever, with CPUParticles2D, it occurs with all emission shape types when the scene root is transformed (like in the testing project):\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3fe42988-2b32-4b26-b2e4-2180eef10bca)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0532f0c4-2e42-4942-be37-f59ab91ce687)\r\n\r\nAlso, Ring emission shape in GPUParticles2D is only drawn if the axis is `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`, but it should also draw when it's `(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)` with the same orientation:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05b06eb5-cc87-4123-9afa-6e1f40c808e2)\r\n\r\nThere's a special behavior that makes the zero axis (which is not a valid unit vector) act like `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`, so that it's easier to configure for 2D users.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102249#pullrequestreview-2602565285","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102249","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-07T18:58:12Z"},{"id":2606139973,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bVopF","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38077837?u=f04bcf5166e53d5346db0d3b10220d3369dbfb51&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/paddy-exe","id":38077837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDc3ODM3","login":"paddy-exe","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102249#pullrequestreview-2606139973","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102249","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-02-10T15:06:40Z"},{"id":2606594920,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bXXto","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4955051?u=ea50b38ba8a7c99b99e7ee08274abc3a70de9cc1&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Arnklit","id":4955051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTUwNTE=","login":"Arnklit","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102249#pullrequestreview-2606594920","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102249","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-02-10T17:06:56Z"},{"id":2606596000,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bXX-g","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4955051?u=ea50b38ba8a7c99b99e7ee08274abc3a70de9cc1&v=4","create